OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with mainly light showers
OL,7,Facross the region this evening but
OL,8,Fespecially near the coast. After
OL,9,Fmidnight, most parts turning dry with
OL,10,Fclear spells developing. A grass frost
OL,11,Fis possible in places. Light winds,
OL,12,Fbreezier near the coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FPartly cloudy with the odd
OL,15,Flight shower around to start. A fine
OL,16,Fday follows with most areas remaining
OL,17,Fdry with light winds and temperatures
OL,18,Fclose to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
